Z||000066||ur2biteme||12-01-2000||02:37 AM||||well, i'm 6'1", 185 and do have a couple issues with the car. (i'm gonna sound like a whiner, but i drive delivery in the thing) i dont like the lack of padding in the base of the seat.  hurts the tailbone.  getting in and out is lots of fun...... right.  i dont see how you guys can stand it lowered, but thats just me and my all leg body speaking.  lol.  <P>hey, am i the only tall guy that sits in the trunk to work on it?  that's the only way to get to the plugs man.  oh, about legroom.  this car has an insane amount of it.  its the only car i've driven that i actually have to move the seat up to drive.  anyway, made a short story long, so later.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>UR2BITEME<BR>'87 econo coupe<BR>170k and a bad fender :(||||reg||1
